s":[],"rep":[]}},{"id":4144,"name":"Bloodpetal Sprouts","level":53,"reqLevel":47,"side":"Alliance","summary":"Here's the plan, <name>: Go out and collect some bloodpetal sprouts -- you know, the plants that haven't fully sprouted yet, and bring them here. Then I'll see what the Atal'ai haze can do.You may think I'm vengeful... Actually, you'd be right about that! Truth is, I know the way out of here, but until Larion will admit that I'm right, I'm staying right here!So off with you, find those bloodpetal sprouts and let's have some fun!","start":{"name":"Muigin","kind":"npc","zone":490,"zoneName":"Un'Goro Crater","coord":[43,9.6]},"end":{"name":"Muigin","kind":"npc","zone":490,"zoneName":"Un'Goro Crater","coord":[43,9.6]},"rewards":{"xp":3950,"choices":[],"items":[],"rep":[]}},{"id":4148,"name":"Bloodpetal Zapper","level":53,"reqLevel":47,"side":"Horde","summary":"For the zapper to work, it needs a sample of the target creature. Head out into the crater and collect a Bloodpetal sprout. Then I can calibrate it to work on Muigin's little friends...If he weren't so stubborn, we could be on our way home, already... But until then, I'll just have to show him that his little prank doesn't bother me at all!","type":"Dungeon","start":{"name":"Larion","kind":"npc","zone":490,"zoneName":"Un'Goro Crater","coord":[45.6,8.6]},"end":{"name":"Larion","kind":"npc","zone":490,"zoneName":"Un'Goro Crater","coord":[45.6,8.6]},"rewards":{"xp":3950,"money":16000,"choices":[],"items":[[11320,1]],"rep":[]}},{"id":4243,"name":"Chasing A-Me 01","level":53,"reqLevel":48,"side":"Both","summary":"Find A-Me 01 in Un'Goro Crater.","start":{"name":"Karna Remtravel","kind":"npc","zone":490,"zoneName":"Un'Goro Crater","coord":[46.4,13.4]},"end":{"name":"A-Me 01","kind":"npc","zone":490,"zoneName":"Un'Goro Crater","coord":[67.6,16.8]},"chain":{"id":"4243","step":1,"length":2},"rewards":{"xp":2650,"choices":[],"items":[],"rep":[]}},{"id":4244,"name":"Chasing A-Me 01","level":53,"reqLevel":48,"side":"Both","summary":"Find a Mithril Casing and return to A-Me 01 in Un'Goro Crater.","start":{"name":"A-Me 01","kind":"npc","zone":490,"zoneName":"Un'Goro Crater","coord":[67.6,16.8]},"end":{"name":"A-Me 01","kind":"npc","zone":490,"zoneName":"Un'Goro Crater","coord":[67.6,16.8]},"chain":{"id":"4243","step":2,"length":2},"rewards":{"xp":3950,"choices":[],"items":[],"rep":[]}},{"id":4245,"name":"Chasing A-Me 01","level":53,"reqLevel":48,"side":"Both","summary":"Escort A-Me 01 back to Karna Remtravel in Un'Goro Crater.","start":{"name":"A-Me 01","kind":"npc","zone":490,"zoneName":"Un'Goro Crater","coord":[67.6,16.8]},"end":{"name":"Karna Remtravel","kind":"npc","zone":490,"zoneName":"Un'Goro Crater","coord":[46.4,13.4]},"rewards":{"xp":6550,"money":16000,"choices":[],"items":[],"rep":[]}},{"id":4385,"name":"Crystal Charge","level":53,"reqLevel":47,"side":"Both","summary":"The Pylon table allows you to combine red power crystals with yellow power crystals.According to J.D.'s manual, this combination can be used to create a large explosion that can inflict damage on your enemies.","start":{"name":"Northern Crystal Pylon","kind":"object","zone":490,"zoneName":"Un'Goro Crater","coord":[56.5,12.4]},"end":{"name":"Northern Crystal Pylon","kind":"object","zone":490,"zoneName":"Un'Goro Crater","coord":[56.5,12.4]},"rewards":{"choices":[],"items":[[11566,1]],"rep":[]}},{"id":4382,"name":"Crystal Force","level":53,"reqLevel":47,"side":"Both","summary":"The Pylon table allows you to combine green power crystals with blue power crystals.According to J.D.'s manual, this combination can be used to increase your spirit.","start":{"name":"Eastern Crystal Pylon","kind":"object","zone":490,"zoneName":"Un'Goro Crater","coord":[77.3,50]},"end":{"name":"Eastern Crystal Pylon","kind":"object","zone":490,"zoneName":"Un'Goro Crater","coord":[77.3,50]},"rewards":{"choices":[],"items":[[11563,1]],"rep":[]}},{"id":4381,"name":"Crystal Restore","level":53,"reqLevel":47,"side":"Both","summary":"The Py